><img src=\"/assets/woden-valley-balcony-broad-membrane-coverage.png\" alt=\"Broad grey membrane coverage across the balcony floor and wall upstands in Woden Valley\" width=\"1448\" height=\"1086\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Broad membrane coverage stage · Floor and wall upstands</figcaption></figure></div><p><a href=\"/services/balcony-waterproofing/\">Explore balcony waterproofing and leak repairs →</a></p></section><!-- supplied-project-photos:end -->",
  "services/external-waterproofing/index.html": "<!-- supplied-project-photos:start --><section class=\"section wrap article\" data-project-photo-group=\"external\" aria-labelledby=\"supplied-external-photos\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Weetangera · April 2026</p><h2 id=\"supplied-external-photos\">Weetangera external wall joint sealing</h2><p>These two photographs show external wall joint sealing: sealant application at a taped vertical joint and a collage of application beside a visible sealed joint.</p><div class=\"grid case-photo-grid supplied-project-photo-grid\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/weetangera-external-wall-joint-application.png\" alt=\"Ellis team member applying sealant along a taped external wall joint in Weetangera\" width=\"1448\" height=\"1086\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Joint sealant application · Taped vertical external wall joint</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/assets/weetangera-external-wall-joint-sealing-collage.png\" alt=\"Collage showing sealant application and a visible sealed external wall joint in Weetangera\" width=\"1448\" height=\"1086\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Application and visible sealed joint · External wall joint sealing collage</figcaption></figure></div><p><a href=\"/services/external-waterproofing/\">Explore external waterproofing and water ingress repairs →</a></p></section><!-- supplied-project-photos:end -->",
  "services/retaining-wall-waterproofing/index.html": "<!-- supplied-project-photos:start --><section class=\"section wrap article\" data-project-photo-group=\"retaining-wall\" aria-labelledby=\"supplied-retaining-wall-photos\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Barton · April 2026</p><h2 id=\"supplied-retaining-wall-photos\">Barton retaining-wall photographs</h2><p>These are separate retaining-wall examples: one block wall and one concrete wall. Each supplied collage shows construction and a visible finished face. They do not establish concealed waterproofing and are not presented as one before-and-after project.</p><div class=\"grid case-photo-grid supplied-project-photo-grid\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/barton-block-retaining-wall-collage.png\" alt=\"Collage showing block retaining-wall construction and a visible finished block face in Barton\" width=\"1448\" height=\"1086\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Block wall · Construction and visible finished face</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/assets/barton-concrete-retaining-wall-collage.png\" alt=\"Collage showing concrete retaining-wall construction with formwork and a visible finished concrete face in Barton\" width=\"1448\" height=\"1086\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Concrete wall · Construction and visible finished face</figcaption></figure></div><p><a href=\"/services/retaining-wall-waterproofing/\">Explore retaining wall waterproofing →</a></p></section><!-- supplied-project-photos:end -->",
